### =========================================================
### ACTIVITY-CONTROLLER
### Cubre: GET /api/v1/activities, GET /api/v1/activities/{id},
###        GET /api/v1/activities/{id}/availability,
###        GET /api/v1/activities/recommended
### =========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = viajero.test@xplorenow.com
@password = Password123

### Login (recomendado/preferencias personalizadas puede requerir auth)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 1. Catálogo paginado, sin filtros
### page y size son required según el swagger
### -----------------------------------------------------
# @name listActivities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@firstActivityId = {{listActivities.response.body.$.content[0].id}}

### 1.b Catálogo con filtro por destino
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=10&destination=Bariloche
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.c Catálogo con filtro por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=10&category=Adventure
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.d Catálogo con rango de precio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=10&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=20000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.e Catálogo con búsqueda por texto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=10&search=free tour
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.f Catálogo combinando todos los filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0&size=5&category=Adventure&destination=Bariloche&minPrice=0&maxPrice=50000&search=trekking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.g Página fuera de rango (debería devolver contenido vacío, no error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=999&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.h Falta parámetro required (size) -> debería devolver 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 2. Detalle de una actividad
### -----------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/{{firstActivityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.b Detalle con id inexistente (debería devolver 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 3. Horarios/disponibilidad de una actividad
### -----------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/{{firstActivityId}}/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.b Disponibilidad de actividad inexistente (según swagger, 404 documentado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/999999/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -----------------------------------------------------
### 4. Actividades recomendadas (según preferencias del perfil)
### -----------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4.b Recomendadas sin token (ver si requiere auth o no)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activities/recommended
